       "code": "public static int Pineapple(Stack<int> st)\n{\n    int x, sod = 0;\n    Stack<int> temp = new Stack<int>();\n    while (!st.IsEmpty())\n    {\n        x = st.Pop();\n        temp.Push(x);\n        sod = sod + x;\n    }\n    while (!temp.IsEmpty())\n        st.Push(temp.Pop());\n    return sod;\n}",
